{
  "_doc": "Stage 16 (V10): the page of ModernUI in the settings and the personal preferences. The cloud has no page for this module, so the pairs compare the components the page is built of with the cloud components of the same role, measured on 2026-11-09 at 1440 x 1000: the frame and the title of a settings page of the cloud (layout v8, Configuration Editor), the record tabs and a secondary button of the record header, the toolbar of a list with its view selector (the scope bar), the cards, labels, fields, footer and Save of the edit window, the discard confirmation, the 'Personalize' editor of the menu with its 'Add modules' panel (groups column, active group, tiles, the Customize button, favourites tiles). Every ModernUI state refers to one cloud state; several ModernUI states share a page. Positions are compared only where the place is the same by construction (the frame, the title); otherwise sizes and computed styles. 'cloud' holds the selectors of the capture (Playwriter, Chrome of the user); measurements and images stay private. The active record tab of the stage 10 components draws its 3 px line as an inset shadow (the cloud: a 3 px bottom border, the same line) — its colour is checked by the foundation scenario, here size, weight and colour of the text. The secondary button of the cloud record header is the left part of a group (radius 4 0 0 4): its radius is compared with the Cancel of the cloud confirmation instead.",
